{"id":"d43649881d4bfbbd","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md","title":"Bracket Polynomial","display":"df-bracket-polynomial — Bracket Polynomial","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-bracket-polynomial","aliases":["58-df-bracket-polynomial","Bracket Polynomial"],"display":"df-bracket-polynomial — Bracket Polynomial","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-bracket-polynomial"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-bracket-polynomial</span><span>Bracket Polynomial</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bracket-polynomial — Bracket Polynomial"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45d02e8df3a08d98\" href=\"?note=45d02e8df3a08d98\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md\">../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,B\\in V\">\\(D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (diagram predicate with its projection data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45d02e8df3a08d98\" href=\"?note=45d02e8df3a08d98\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md\">../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (finiteness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S\\subseteq V^{12}\">\\(\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S\\subseteq V^{12}\\)</span> (state-sum graph predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\in V\">\\(A,\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\in V\\)</span> (formal indeterminate and Laurent-polynomial ring)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bracket-polynomial} \\vdash \\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,K,q,h,\\pi,o)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathcal S,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathcal S,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal S,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\land B\\in\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\land B=\\sum_{s\\in\\mathcal S}A^{a(s)-b(s)}(-A^2-A^{-2})^{c(s)-1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bracket-polynomial} \\vdash \\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,K,q,h,\\pi,o)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathcal S,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathcal S,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal S,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\land B\\in\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\land B=\\sum_{s\\in\\mathcal S}A^{a(s)-b(s)}(-A^2-A^{-2})^{c(s)-1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The atom now defines the algebraic state-sum graph relative to explicit finite smoothing data.  It does not hide the smoothing-state set or its counting maps in an undefined operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S(D)\">\\(\\mathcal S(D)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A canonical diagram-to-polynomial operation additionally needs a formal smoothing-data atom; until then the unindexed notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle D\\rangle_A\">\\(\\langle D\\rangle_A\\)</span> is intentionally not asserted here.</li>\n<li>Kauffman bracket: invariant of regular isotopy (Reidemeister II + III)</li>\n<li>The bracket does not require an orientation, but the diagram still carries over/under crossing data.</li>\n<li>Jones polynomial: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_L(t)=(-t^{-3/4})^{-w(D)}\\langle D\\rangle_{A=t^{-1/4}}\">\\(V_L(t)=(-t^{-3/4})^{-w(D)}\\langle D\\rangle_{A=t^{-1/4}}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Reidemeister I: adds writhe factor to convert to knot invariant</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kauffman, State Models and the Jones Polynomial</li>\n<li>Jones, Hecke algebras and representation of braid groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md","status":"resolved","id":"45d02e8df3a08d98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md","status":"resolved","id":"45d02e8df3a08d98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (diagram predicate with its projection data, see [[../batch02/58-df-knot-diagram.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (finiteness predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,A,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S\\subseteq V^{12}","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bracket-polynomial} \\vdash \\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S(B,D,K,q,h,\\pi,o,\\mathcal S,a,b,c,A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{KnotDiagram}_S(D,K,q,h,\\pi,o)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\mathcal S,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(b,\\mathcal S,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\mathcal S,\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\})\\land B\\in\\mathbb Z[A,A^{-1}]\\land B=\\sum_{s\\in\\mathcal S}A^{a(s)-b(s)}(-A^2-A^{-2})^{c(s)-1}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle D\\rangle_A","display":false},{"tex":"V_L(t)=(-t^{-3/4})^{-w(D)}\\langle D\\rangle_{A=t^{-1/4}}","display":false}],"bytes":2241,"backlinks":[{"id":"b2f39aba43091cc3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0a9a8cb11b4dac7a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BracketStateSum}_S:V^{12}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-bracket-polynomial]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-bracket-polynomial.md|58-df-bracket-polynomial]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["45d02e8df3a08d98","d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751"]}